## Subgroup analysis - proportion, marginal

- `NetFreq` is how often people use the internet (categorical)
- `AgeGroup` is a categorical age variable


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="show"}
ess_des |>
  filter(cntry == "FR", !is.na(NetFreq), !is.na(AgeGroup)) |>
  group_by(AgeGroup, NetFreq) |>
  summarize(
    N = survey_total() * 10000,
    p = survey_prop() * 100
  ) |>
  gt() |>
  fmt_number(decimal = 1, columns = starts_with("p")) |>
  fmt_number(decimal = 0, columns = c(N, N_se)) |>
  opt_interactive(page_size_default = 8)
```

